                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Note:</hi> SCA opposes the closing of the following posts
                    listed above because of their importance in consular work: Mexicali, Piedras
                    Negras, Aruba, Trieste, St. John, Haifa, Capetown, and Durban.</p>
                <p>SCA suggests the following posts not listed above might be considered for
                    closing: Cork, Edinburgh, Manchester or Liverpool, Turin, La Havre, Southampton,
                    Vera Cruz.</p>
